<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<?mso-application progid="Excel.Sheet"?><Workbook xmlns="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet" xmlns:ss="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet">
    <Worksheet ss:Name="Dia">
      <Table>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">ID</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">zho</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Comments</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Reference texts</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_Fvlad_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你怎么就是学不会君子动口不动手呢！
向#Boss_n12;解释整个世界正面临一个极大的危险
就这么难吗？！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">You have no social skills whatsoever! How hard could it be to just open your mouth and explain to #Boss_n12; that the world is in peril?!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_Fvlad_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">好吧，我们似乎误打误撞地接近了目的地。
#Boss_N14;就住在前面古老的遗迹里。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Well then, by chance we seem to have ended up somewhere close to our destination. #Boss_N14; lives in the ancient troll ruins up ahead.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_Fvlad_intro3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">找到，然后进入#Location_ru;。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Find and enter #Location_ru;.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_Fvlad_hide</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这是一大群怪物军团。
好汉不吃眼前亏，
我劝你最好先躲起来。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">That's the entire dwarven army. I suppose a lesser man would hide.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_Fvlad_afterhide</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">哇哦，这不是传说中的神马军队…
如果你够勇敢的话，我们应该继续向前。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Wow, your martial prowess is surely the stuff of legends… If you dare, we should continue onwards.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_Fvlad_beforefaf</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">现在…我先明确一下：
[P=2]你必须向#Boss_N14;解释发生过什么。
#Boss_N14;是一个非常古老而智慧的存在，
他肯定能理解这一切的！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Now... Let me make myself perfectly clear: [P=2]you must explain to #Boss_N14; what has happened. His apperance aside, #Boss_N14; is a very old and wise being and must see reason in all this!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_dragon_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">是谁？扰龙清梦…
又是一群妄图龙之宝藏的愚蠢之徒吗……</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Who disturbs my slumber... Fool... Throwing away your life in hopes of winning a fortune.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_dragon_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">吾要终结汝这不敬的人类后辈。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I will destroy you for your lack of respect.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_Fvlad_faf1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">住手！…[P=1]放开那只巨龙！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">dragon is defeated</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Stooo-[P=1]op!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_dragon_defeat1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#Her_Fvlad;？[P=1]
是你吗？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#Her_Fvlad;?[P=1] Is that you?</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_Fvlad_faf2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">是的#Boss_n14;，的确是我。
我们的旧敌#Boss_n15;已经再次回来了。
他试图破坏整个#Location_midG;！
帮助我们吧#Boss_n14;,你是唯一的希望。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">princess leia (help me obi wan kenobi, you're my only hope)</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Yes #Boss_n14;, It is indeed. #Boss_n15; our old foe, has returned once more, and is attempting to destroy all of #Location_midG;! Help us #Boss_n14;, you're our only hope.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_dragon_defeat2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">啊…[P=2]我教给你这个魔法，
把#Boss_n15;从他的虚空领域拉进我们的世界，
那样就能打败他了。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Ah...[P=2] Then I give to you this Magick to draw #Boss_n15; out of his realm and into ours, where he can be defeated.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_dragon_defeat3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">但要小心！
就算他的力量只有相当于在虚空领域的一部分, 
他将仍然是#Location_midg;上最强大的存在。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">But beware: even though his powers will be only a fraction of what they are in the ethereal realm, he shall still be the most powerful being #Location_midg; will have ever known.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_dragon_defeat4</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我现在将要把你传送到#Location_EW;，
精确到你们前一次穿越刚刚发生过的那一刻。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I will now return you to #Location_EW;, to the exact same place where this paradox first took form.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_dwarf_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这里是恐惧之地！
你会为你的擅入付出代价。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">a dwarf's not-so-gentle welcome</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">This is sacred ground! You will pay for your intrusion!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_dwarf_alarm</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">入侵者！他们在这！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The intruders! They are here!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_Text_dwarf_search</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我们要找出那些入侵者！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">We march to find the intruders!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
