            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_PoI_statue_monk</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">两个巨人正给谁下跪，恩，那可能是他们的精神领袖。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Two trolls kneeling to some kind of spiritual leader.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_PoI_statue_warlord</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这可能是巨人的头领。
想象下一个巨人军团，真是太恐怖了。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">A troll warlord of some kind. An army of trolls is a scary thought.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_PoI_fire</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">地面上有些烧灼过的迹象，再烧一次看看？</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">There is a flame symbol on the ground.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_PoI_hall_debris</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这里已经变成废墟。</Data>
