          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">This place has really fallen apart.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#RU_PoI_princesses</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这里有好多位公主的…算了还是别说出来，不知道马里奥会怎么想。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
